    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir9">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e98">Caput 9</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1194A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_1@1-3">Non zeles mulierem,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir9-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-sir9-Nd1e112" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">Docet pudicitiam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non consentit haereticae pravitati.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e126">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_3@3-4">Mulierem multivolam.</quote>
            Haereticorum Synagogam, quae per diversos errores volitat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e135">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e137">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e139">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e141" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_4@1-5">Cum saltatrice ne assiduus sis.</quote>
            Haereticorum turba, quae per diversos errores dissilit, ut quem eloquentiae suae amatorem conspexerit ad se trahat quasi meretrix; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e144" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov7_21@1-8">Irretivit eum multis sermonibus, et blanditiis labiorum traxit eum</quote>, etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e149">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e151">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e153">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e155" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_5@1-3">Virginem ne conspicias.</quote>
            Averte oculos tuos, ne videant vanitatem: ne libeat videre quae non licet concupiscere. Mystice autem non debemus decorem eloquentiae haereticae amare, nec simulatas <pb ed="#P" n="1194B"/> virtutes attendere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e163">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e165">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e167">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_7@3-5">In vicis civitatis,</quote>
            etc. Idem sub alia figura. Vici enim civitatis, haereticorum conventicula sunt: quae se a civitate separant, de qua dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e172" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps86_3@1-7">Gloriosa dicta sunt de te, civitas Dei</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e177">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e179">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e181">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e183" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_14@1-3">Ne derelinquas amicum.</quote>
            Major est fiducia ex parte rei cognitae, quam ignotae. Doctrinam quoque sanctorum Patrum non debemus declinare et novellos doctores audire.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e188">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e190">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e192">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e194" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_15@1-2">Vinum novum,</quote>
            etc. Novus doctor studere debet, ut sanam doctrinam et operationem firmiter percipiat: et postea sibi et aliis proficiat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir9-Dd1e199">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir9-Hd1e201">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir9-d1e203">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir9-Qd1e205" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir9_25@7-7">Linguosus.</quote>
            Haereticus, qui semper contentiosus, et ideo odibilis Deo et hominibus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
